### Valid bug
POST http://localhost:5165/bugs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5,
  "title": "Search button broken",
  "severity": "High",
  "isResolved": false
}

### Invalid - empty title
POST http://localhost:5165/bugs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 6,
  "title": "",
  "severity": "Medium",
  "isResolved": false
}

### Invalid - bad severity
POST http://localhost:5165/bugs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 7,
  "title": "Random bug",
  "severity": "Urgent",
  "isResolved": false
}





### ---------------------------






### Valid PUT
PUT http://localhost:5165/bugs/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Updated page title bug",
  "severity": "High",
  "isResolved": false
}

### Missing bug
PUT http://localhost:5165/bugs/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Missing bug",
  "severity": "Low",
  "isResolved": false
}

### Invalid severity
PUT http://localhost:5165/bugs/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "title": "Bad update",
  "severity": "Urgent",
  "isResolved": false
}











### Resolve existing bug
PATCH http://localhost:5165/bugs/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isResolved": true
}

### Verify
GET http://localhost:5165/bugs/3

### Mark unresolved again
PATCH http://localhost:5165/bugs/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isResolved": false
}

### Missing bug
PATCH http://localhost:5165/bugs/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isResolved": true
}





### ----------------------


### Delete existing bug
DELETE http://localhost:5165/bugs/4

### Delete same bug again
DELETE http://localhost:5165/bugs/4

### Check remaining bugs
GET http://localhost:5165/bugs






